  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cofinancing of the Productive Safety Net Adaptable Program Lending III Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The Development Objective of the PSNP APL III is to improve effectiveness and efficiency of the
 Productive Safety Net Program (PSNP) for
 the chronically food insecure households in rural Ethiopia.
 
 This Grant will fund Component 1 and Component 3 of the PSNP Program:
 Component 1: Safety Nets Grants.
 Component 3: Institutional Support of the PSNP.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
